      "body": "## Motivation\n\nMake startup a little faster by avoiding redundant tokenizer initialization. Fixes #45094.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Reuse the scheduler's tokenizer in the same-process TP worker for the standard text HuggingFace path.\n- Load only the pre-tokenizer and decoder when applying the v5 compatibility fix, without rebuilding the vocabulary.\n\n## Validation\n\n- 152 unit tests and pre-commit passed.\n- Local Qwen3-32B-FP8 on one H100: the component repair step dropped from about 240 ms to 18 ms. Startup followed by 32 concurrent generation requests passed.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39203836020](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39203836020)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39203835810](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39203835810)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39203836010](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39203836010)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
